as soon as you came...

249
00:22:29.125 --> 00:22:29.957
ABCs?

250
00:22:30.041 --> 00:22:32.790
Yes... Affluent Brats
and their Companions...

251
00:22:32.958 --> 00:22:34.957
Look how they are staring at you!

252
00:22:35.583 --> 00:22:36.874
I'm not scared of anyone...

253
00:22:37.125 --> 00:22:39.249
Hey... hey... Where are you off?

254
00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:40.660
There's a seat empty there...

255
00:22:40.666 --> 00:22:42.499
So is your pocket...

256
00:22:42.583 --> 00:22:46.040
Just sit with the nerdy gang...
Be in your bank limit...

257
00:22:46.416 --> 00:22:48.582
Going to open a new account...
Want to join?

258
00:22:48.666 --> 00:22:49.790
Death wish!

259
00:23:08.666 --> 00:23:13.415
New term... New dreams and a
new challenge for all of you...

260
00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:18.874
Which I started 25 years ago...

261
00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:23.499
There's only one out of you
who will win the trophy...

262
00:23:24.166 --> 00:23:26.415
The only one who's higher studies

263
00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:29.582
will be at an
International Ivy League college

264
00:23:29.666 --> 00:23:33.957
and will be sponsored by St.
Teresa's trust fund...

265
00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:51.874
Your Dad looks dashing...

266
00:24:08.583 --> 00:24:10.165
I can do two things right now...

267
00:24:10.250 --> 00:24:13.874
One, I can share some
bookish knowledge with you...

268
00:24:14.125 --> 00:24:17.124
Or then I can mirror
real life for you guys...

269
00:24:17.583 --> 00:24:19.790
Because no one has
made money till date

270
00:24:19.875 --> 00:24:21.582
by either reading or
teaching text books...

271
00:24:22.166 --> 00:24:26.332
If that was possible your
teaching faculty would be here

272
00:24:26.416 --> 00:24:28.124
and I would be there...
In their place...

273
00:24:35.333 --> 00:24:38.499
Teachers teach rules...

274
00:24:39.166 --> 00:24:44.040
But winners make them...

275
00:25:01.416 --> 00:25:04.124
And the whole school talks
about your football skills...

276
00:25:04.583 --> 00:25:06.165
Don't you want to play for the team?

277
00:25:07.416 --> 00:25:08.665
So why didn't you ask?

278
00:25:09.583 --> 00:25:11.415
Borrowed things have
to be returned, Sir...

279
00:25:11.500 --> 00:25:12.790
I want to earn it...

280
00:25:13.541 --> 00:25:15.957
It's football... Not lottery...

281
00:25:19.958 --> 00:25:23.040
Let's see if your dribbling
skills are as sharp as your tongue...

282
00:25:28.958 --> 00:25:29.638
"Kick it."

283
00:25:52.041 --> 00:25:52.957
"Yeah."

284
00:25:53.583 --> 00:25:54.249
"Kick it."

285
00:26:06.791 --> 00:26:08.499
This Abhimanyu must
be shown his place...

286
00:26:08.583 --> 00:26:10.249
Why? Hasn't he settled in his room?

287
00:26:11.125 --> 00:26:12.415
He was being hero on
the field today...

288
00:26:12.500 --> 00:26:15.165
But boss...
He does play the game very well...

289
00:26:15.416 --> 00:26:18.249
That even you do...
Nothing great with that...

290
00:26:18.500 --> 00:26:20.332
Some games have to be
played off the field...

291
00:26:20.500 --> 00:26:22.661
You go and somehow get
the keys for the notice board...

292
00:26:32.791 --> 00:26:34.511
Used to play with
the boys in the village...

293
00:26:34.583 --> 00:26:37.165
Really? That's why you play rough...

294
00:26:38.583 --> 00:26:40.957
Don't know about rough...
I play solid...

295
00:26:41.500 --> 00:26:43.957
Sometimes you tend to lose
form when you focus on style...

296
00:26:45.500 --> 00:26:47.249
Listen you village Beckham...

297
00:26:47.666 --> 00:26:49.146
Arrogance must have its boundaries...

298
00:26:49.416 --> 00:26:50.936
That place, in this college,
is mine...

299
00:26:51.583 --> 00:26:53.957
Why? Are you the PM's son?

300
00:26:54.416 --> 00:26:55.499
Think of it like that...

301
00:26:56.875 --> 00:26:59.499
Don't worry...
I will vote for your Pappa!

302
00:27:02.041 --> 00:27:04.165
So much anger... Such attitude...

303
00:27:04.875 --> 00:27:06.124
It's not good for your health!

304
00:27:07.791 --> 00:27:09.124
Now you are being a mother?

305
00:27:09.166 --> 00:27:10.582
No... Father...

306
00:27:11.583 --> 00:27:12.582
Yours...

307
00:27:15.333 --> 00:27:16.415
After the medical...

308
00:27:19.791 --> 00:27:23.790
It's written on the notice board...
In English... Read it...

309
00:27:35.041 --> 00:27:37.874
Dimpy... Just give this...
This to Coach Shah...

310
00:27:38.041 --> 00:27:39.040
What's in it?

311
00:27:40.166 --> 00:27:41.665
This has... that... My...

312
00:27:41.791 --> 00:27:42.957
Your?

313
00:27:43.875 --> 00:27:46.124
That thing...
On the notice board... My...

314
00:27:46.333 --> 00:27:49.415
Why are you being a coy bride?
Just give it...

315
00:27:49.958 --> 00:27:51.415
I'm going to Coach's house...

316
00:27:51.958 --> 00:27:54.038
Will give it... This time free...
Next time charge...

317
00:28:00.666 --> 00:28:02.249
God... I'm late... He'll be asleep...

318
00:28:02.500 --> 00:28:04.957
Dimpy listen... Just leave this...

319
00:28:05.166 --> 00:28:05.874
Listen...

320
00:28:06.125 --> 00:28:08.790
Munni is notorious but not young while
Sheila is young but not notorious...

321
00:28:08.875 --> 00:28:10.124
Why Dimpy? Why?

322
00:28:10.166 --> 00:28:12.582
How do I know? I'm a boy...
Not FM radio...

323
00:28:12.666 --> 00:28:15.165
Just take this... Watch some TV...

324
00:28:15.875 --> 00:28:18.165
Silly rich kids and their tails...

325
00:28:19.166 --> 00:28:24.249
If I ring the bell he will be
angry... Will leave it here...

326
00:28:26.791 --> 00:28:34.249
"Hail Lord Om Jai Jagdish."

327
00:28:34.416 --> 00:28:37.874
"You ease the
problems of your devotees.."

328
00:28:38.791 --> 00:28:40.124
Respected Coach sir...

329
00:28:40.166 --> 00:28:41.499
Thank you from the bottom of my heart

330
00:28:41.583 --> 00:28:42.874
for selecting me in
the football team...

331
00:28:42.958 --> 00:28:44.665
I'm sending you some holy water...

332
00:28:44.791 --> 00:28:45.874
That's nice

333
00:28:45.958 --> 00:28:50.957
Hope it purifies your home and
your family just as it has, mine...

334
00:28:51.125 --> 00:28:52.665
Your own Abhimanyu Singh...

335
00:28:52.875 --> 00:28:55.249
He is a sweet boy!
He has sent holy water...

336
00:28:55.666 --> 00:28:58.874
Holy water?
Let me sprinkle it through the house...

337
00:28:59.333 --> 00:29:02.040
Silly... My home is you...

338
00:29:07.500 --> 00:29:10.165
And how can we forget
the light of our lives...

339
00:29:10.666 --> 00:29:12.665
My son... Live long...

340
00:29:13.875 --> 00:29:16.165
Here... Holy water... Keep it safe...

341
00:29:19.041 --> 00:29:19.790
What happened?

342
00:29:19.958 --> 00:29:21.332
Su su...

343
00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.499
Is this your prank or did
someone else have a hand?

344
00:29:32.583 --> 00:29:33.957
Must have done it himself...

345
00:29:34.500 --> 00:29:36.040
Why does he need someone else's hand?

346
00:29:40.666 --> 00:29:41.665
Say...

347
00:29:48.333 --> 00:29:49.415
Sir, I did it...

348
00:29:53.791 --> 00:29:55.311
If you stop... Start all over again...

349
00:29:59.666 --> 00:30:04.124
You... You... Listen DK Bose...
Stop running and listen...

350
00:30:04.166 --> 00:30:05.165
Say...

351
00:30:05.250 --> 00:30:06.730
I have a dance booking with Pseudo...

352
00:30:07.166 --> 00:30:08.957
Just give me 100 bucks and
I'll say you finished your rounds...

353
00:30:09.041 --> 00:30:11.124
You give me 100 bucks and
I will say you watched me run...

354
00:30:11.250 --> 00:30:13.124
You will grow up to be a politician...

355
00:30:13.166 --> 00:30:14.790
Did I ask for the bribe?

356
00:30:15.875 --> 00:30:16.665
Now go...

357
00:30:23.250 --> 00:30:25.124
No matter how much
Rohan acted as a toughie...

358
00:30:25.166 --> 00:30:27.124
He was a softie at heart...

359
00:30:29.041 --> 00:30:33.165
Hey... Hey... Hello...
I'm talking to you...

360
00:30:33.958 --> 00:30:34.874
Abhimanyu...

361
00:30:34.958 --> 00:30:39.040
Thanks for yesterday...
But you didn't have to save us...

362
00:30:39.500 --> 00:30:41.124
I know... I didn't have to at all...

363
00:30:41.250 --> 00:30:42.332
Then why did you do it?

364
00:30:42.583 --> 00:30:43.957
I was trying to act great...

365
00:30:44.166 --> 00:30:46.249
Wanted to know how
great people feel...

366
00:30:46.500 --> 00:30:48.332
You do know a few of
yours are loose...

367
00:30:48.875 --> 00:30:50.790
Mine are a few loose...
You don't have them...

368
00:30:52.041 --> 00:30:55.040
You have heard my Dad...
It would rub off wouldn't it?

369
00:30:55.250 --> 00:30:56.874
Your Dad is not insane...

370
00:30:57.125 --> 00:30:59.249
He's just a little crooked!
And he should be...

371
00:30:59.416 --> 00:31:01.957
To reach that position
you need to be crooked...

372
00:31:02.125 --> 00:31:04.957
Wow... Gandhi in your hands
and such lofty thoughts...

373
00:31:06.666 --> 00:31:09.165
He should be in your pocket...
Not in your hands...

374
00:31:09.333 --> 00:31:10.415
God made a mistake...

375
00:31:10.791 --> 00:31:12.311
You should have been
my father's son...

376
00:31:12.666 --> 00:31:14.124
Why do you care
so much about your Dad?

377
00:31:14.166 --> 00:31:16.249
I don't...
I don't care about anyone...

378
00:31:16.458 --> 00:31:17.332
You do...

379
00:31:17.416 --> 00:31:20.790
You want to earn his respect but he
doesn't even want to loan it to you...

380
00:31:20.875 --> 00:31:22.249
Wow...

381
00:31:22.416 --> 00:31:25.124
Now you are an expert in
the parents' philosophy too?

382
00:31:25.416 --> 00:31:28.165
Yes I have... After they left...

383
00:31:28.333 --> 00:31:29.499
Left? On a holiday?

384
00:31:33.416 --> 00:31:35.249
Why are you giving a shot?
Yours are alive... Come on...

385
00:31:35.333 --> 00:31:38.874
You do know you are a big....

386
00:31:39.250 --> 00:31:40.124
Yes I know...

387
00:31:48.666 --> 00:31:50.582
Come... Come with me to
the canteen... It's time...

388
00:31:50.666 --> 00:31:52.040
Time for what?
- Shanaya...

389
00:31:55.500 --> 00:31:58.957
This year the head
cheerleader for the football team is...

390
00:31:59.250 --> 00:32:00.874
Tanya Israni...

391
00:32:03.250 --> 00:32:04.874
You must be feeling terrible...

392
00:32:05.041 --> 00:32:07.165
Because this position
is normally given to the

393
00:32:07.250 --> 00:32:08.530
most popular girl in the school?

394
00:32:10.416 --> 00:32:14.790
To hold pom poms in hands and
scream for the boys is not my style...

395
00:32:15.041 --> 00:32:19.249
They scream for me...
Whistle... That's more my thing!

396
00:32:24.166 --> 00:32:24.846
"Shanaya."

397
00:32:34.333 --> 00:32:38.165
"Bright like moon
with golden tresses."

398
00:32:38.250 --> 00:32:39.499
"Here we go."

399
00:32:41.500 --> 00:32:45.332
"These blue eyes
have some secret in it."

400
00:32:45.416 --> 00:32:48.415
"Shanaya."

401
00:32:48.500 --> 00:32:52.040
"Bright like moon
with golden tresses."

402
00:32:52.125 --> 00:32:55.499
"These blue eyes
have some secret in it."

403
00:32:55.583 --> 00:33:01.874
"How do I praise
the one who made you?"

404
00:33:01.958 --> 00:33:04.499
"Shanaya."

405
00:33:04.583 --> 00:33:10.499
"How do I praise
the one who made you?"

406
00:33:10.583 --> 00:33:11.263
"Shanaya."

407
00:33:17.041 --> 00:33:20.582
"Shanaya.
- I want to be like Shanaya."

408
00:33:20.666 --> 00:33:22.665
"Shanaya."

409
00:33:23.791 --> 00:33:30.124
"How do I praise the
one who made you?"

410
00:33:30.916 --> 00:33:31.596
"Shanaya."

411
00:33:47.500 --> 00:33:49.249
So much love... So much attention...

412
00:33:49.333 --> 00:33:51.165
Are you ill? Or have you recovered?

413
00:33:51.250 --> 00:33:52.249
I have improved...

414
00:33:52.333 --> 00:33:54.665
Or you just want to
show the whole world

415
00:33:54.750 --> 00:33:56.165
that you are still
Shanaya Singhania's boyfriend?

416
00:33:56.250 --> 00:33:58.874
You would have made such a good boy...

417
00:33:58.958 --> 00:34:01.415
God fell asleep and
you were born a girl...

418
00:34:02.250 --> 00:34:04.040
I think you are asleep...

419
00:34:04.250 --> 00:34:06.582
That's why you can't
see your competition...

420
00:34:08.416 --> 00:34:11.124
So you are the new
boy in the school...

421
00:34:12.166 --> 00:34:14.124
As if you didn't notice before...

422
00:34:14.416 --> 00:34:16.957
Just saw... Noticing is too far off!

423
00:34:18.416 --> 00:34:19.499
Jeet... Chair!

424
00:34:19.583 --> 00:34:20.499
No, I'm comfortable boss.

425
00:34:20.583 --> 00:34:22.249
Not for you... For Shanaya...

426
00:34:22.333 --> 00:34:24.415
Yeah.
- No, it's okay. We have class.

427
00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:40.332
Whatever your plan is, I'm just happy
that I have worthy rival in school!

428
00:34:46.875 --> 00:34:49.249
Friction, jealousy, love,
friendship...

429
00:34:49.333 --> 00:34:51.582
This was all a daily
routine with St. T's...

430
00:34:51.791 --> 00:34:55.499
But every second weekend all
of us got a reality check...

431
00:34:55.958 --> 00:34:59.499
When we went back home...
Into our real world...

432
00:35:04.166 --> 00:35:05.332
Do you think
we'll have mid-term polls?

433
00:35:05.416 --> 00:35:06.332
There are chances...

434
00:35:07.625 --> 00:35:10.665
Our stocks have just stabilized...
If there are midterm polls...

435
00:35:16.958 --> 00:35:19.124
When did you develop this new hobby?

436
00:35:20.041 --> 00:35:23.040
It's our job to think in this
house... You just strum the guitar...

437
00:35:26.166 --> 00:35:28.540
It was a joke... You are
important too in this family..

438
00:35:28.625 --> 00:35:31.332
After all, you will decide who will
play the band in my wedding, right?

439
00:35:31.416 --> 00:35:34.040
Enough.. Stop! No more...

440
00:35:36.500 --> 00:35:40.415
I think it will be a year or
even two before we stabilize...

441
00:35:41.166 --> 00:35:43.415
Ashok Nanda has
influence till Delhi...

442
00:35:44.083 --> 00:35:46.540
You don't give up on your
friendship with Rohan...

443
00:35:47.291 --> 00:35:49.082
He got you into the school...

444
00:35:49.416 --> 00:35:50.936
He will be of use in the future too...

445
00:35:51.000 --> 00:35:54.540
What's that supposed to mean?
Even I have my own personality...

446
00:35:54.625 --> 00:35:58.832
Shut up you idiot!
A man is either a spoon or a fork!

447
00:35:59.625 --> 00:36:01.374
And you are exactly
like your father...

448
00:36:01.958 --> 00:36:05.707
A spoon... You don't
have it in you to be a fork!

449
00:36:07.291 --> 00:36:09.707
Shut up!

450
00:36:11.708 --> 00:36:14.832
I believe the stocks of your
husband's company have fallen...

451
00:36:16.708 --> 00:36:20.457
So what if the stocks have fallen...
The rocks are still solid...

452
00:36:20.541 --> 00:36:21.915
I'm pregnant...

453
00:36:32.208 --> 00:36:34.999
Shanaya's father is
back in the headlines...

454
00:36:35.625 --> 00:36:37.874
I hope you are
taking good care of her...

455
00:36:38.500 --> 00:36:40.915
I'm her friend, not
her security guard!

456
00:36:44.291 --> 00:36:45.832
Everything's alright in school, Abhi?

457
00:36:45.958 --> 00:36:47.290
Yes uncle...

458
00:36:48.833 --> 00:36:51.915
I needed some money for
the science project...

459
00:36:52.208 --> 00:36:54.624
Of course... Mr Ambani...

460
00:36:54.833 --> 00:36:56.707
Why don't you withdraw some
money from your Swiss bank account

461
00:36:56.833 --> 00:36:57.707
and give it to him?

462
00:36:58.083 --> 00:36:59.290
Stop it...

463
00:36:59.458 --> 00:37:00.915
I will give it tomorrow my son...

464
00:37:04.083 --> 00:37:06.082
There's no salt in the food today...

465
00:37:06.250 --> 00:37:09.124
Anyway... I guess it's ok...

466
00:37:12.208 --> 00:37:14.582
Is Shanaya still Rohan's girlfriend?

467
00:37:16.291 --> 00:37:18.540
I got you some push
up bras from London...

468
00:37:18.916 --> 00:37:20.207
Are you wearing them?

469
00:37:31.500 --> 00:37:33.540
I will win Student
of the Year trophy...

470
00:37:35.916 --> 00:37:39.999
Very good... But who are you?

471
00:37:41.375 --> 00:37:42.832
I'm Kaizad...

472
00:38:12.625 --> 00:38:15.040
Why are you pressing
like a girl? Do it harder...

473
00:38:15.166 --> 00:38:16.487
I can't do it harder than this...

474
00:38:19.083 --> 00:38:21.844
They say if you press certain
points in your body, the pain is less...

475
00:38:22.708 --> 00:38:24.468
I think your wife is
troubling you at home...

476
00:38:26.375 --> 00:38:28.207
She loves me a lot...

477
00:38:29.666 --> 00:38:33.082
I'm actually a bit concerned with
the captaincy of the football team...

478
00:38:35.000 --> 00:38:36.999
Between Rohan and Abhimanyu...

479
00:38:37.208 --> 00:38:40.040
By the way Rohan's
Dad is a childhood friend of mine...

480
00:38:40.375 --> 00:38:42.082
We grew up together...

481
00:38:44.708 --> 00:38:46.707
But obviously you aren't suggesting

482
00:38:46.833 --> 00:38:48.513
I make Rohan
the captain because of that...

483
00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:52.457
I don't care who the captain is...

484
00:38:52.541 --> 00:38:54.999
We just have to defeat St. Lawrence...

485
00:38:55.708 --> 00:38:57.832
They have been winning
consistently for 25 years...

486
00:38:58.125 --> 00:39:00.874
And that mean Dean from there,
Harkisan Sanan...

487
00:39:02.041 --> 00:39:04.207
He has been
torturing me for years now...

488
00:39:07.875 --> 00:39:10.374
"I'm God's devotee."

489
00:39:12.541 --> 00:39:16.374
Last year when you arrived
I felt you are the one...

490
00:39:16.833 --> 00:39:19.082
Who will seek revenge for
all the things done to me...

491
00:39:21.625 --> 00:39:22.707
You will, won't you?

492
00:39:37.166 --> 00:39:40.957
After much thought I have decided that

493
00:39:42.166 --> 00:39:47.290
The captain of the St. Teresa's
football team is Jeet Khurana...

494
00:39:48.291 --> 00:39:50.082
What did I do wrong, Sir?

495
00:39:50.208 --> 00:39:53.457
You heard me right?
You are the captain this year...

496
00:39:53.833 --> 00:39:55.790
And we have to win
at any cost this year!

497
00:39:55.958 --> 00:39:58.207
Is that why we chose Jeet?

498
00:39:59.666 --> 00:40:01.165
I would have made
a better captain than you...

499
00:40:01.250 --> 00:40:03.124
There can only be one
football on the field!

500
00:40:04.916 --> 00:40:06.707
And then came the day when
