01:24:36.500 --> 01:24:38.101
What are we looking for?
Teacher or Tree?

990
01:24:38.125 --> 01:24:39.325
We are looking for the clue...

991
01:24:40.416 --> 01:24:42.499
If you have a better idea,
tell us Shanaya...

992
01:24:43.875 --> 01:24:44.832
Yeah Just leave sister-in-law alone...

993
01:24:44.958 --> 01:24:46.638
She must be your sister-in-law,
not mine...

994
01:24:47.125 --> 01:24:48.249
Think... Who is the teacher?

995
01:24:48.875 --> 01:24:50.332
The Lord and the teacher!
- Shut up.

996
01:24:50.500 --> 01:24:52.040
There is no Gurudwara in the campus...

997
01:24:52.166 --> 01:24:53.415
I think we should have one...

998
01:24:53.500 --> 01:24:54.499
Why don't you suggest it to Yogi?

999
01:24:54.625 --> 01:24:55.582
Ok I will...

1000
01:24:56.041 --> 01:24:59.415
Yogi... He is our teacher...

1001
01:24:59.666 --> 01:25:03.332
Beautiful tree, teacher loves it...

1002
01:25:03.416 --> 01:25:05.332
He talks to his bonsai everyday...

1003
01:25:06.250 --> 01:25:08.582
One second...
Is his mother's name Bonsai?

1004
01:25:12.250 --> 01:25:13.851
The answer lies in
the ray of sunlight...

1005
01:25:14.125 --> 01:25:17.749
Ray of sunlight... Angel's song...

1006
01:25:25.833 --> 01:25:27.582
Last step... Last mystery...

1007
01:25:27.666 --> 01:25:29.332
How strong is your chemistry?

1008
01:25:34.666 --> 01:25:36.999
This is not a tree... It's a shrub!

1009
01:25:38.125 --> 01:25:39.665
The first voice of
Independent India...

1010
01:25:39.750 --> 01:25:41.499
The answer lies in a silent room...

1011
01:25:42.416 --> 01:25:44.957
The silent room is the library...

1012
01:25:50.250 --> 01:25:51.915
Pseudo... This is blank!

1013
01:25:52.041 --> 01:25:54.124
I apologize on behalf
of the treasure hunt...

1014
01:25:54.333 --> 01:25:56.499
Guys please. Think about the clue...

1015
01:25:58.416 --> 01:26:00.665
How strong is our chemistry...

1016
01:26:01.958 --> 01:26:05.165
Enough... I don't want to
play this game anymore...

1017
01:26:05.250 --> 01:26:08.665
Who's going to answer
in a silent room? Books?

1018
01:26:08.750 --> 01:26:10.911
Shut up... What's the first
voice of Independent India?

1019
01:26:11.458 --> 01:26:12.332
Long Live motherland!

1020
01:26:12.416 --> 01:26:13.665
It said voice... Not a slogan!

1021
01:26:13.750 --> 01:26:15.190
I think it must be Mahatma Gandhi...

1022
01:26:16.041 --> 01:26:18.957
I think she's right...
He went on a diet for our country...

1023
01:26:19.250 --> 01:26:19.999
Fast...

1024
01:26:20.125 --> 01:26:21.249
I can't say it any faster than this...

1025
01:26:21.333 --> 01:26:23.665
Not Mahatma Gandhi...
It's Jawaharlal Nehru...

1026
01:26:23.750 --> 01:26:25.999
India's first speech was
by Jawaharlal Nehru...

1027
01:26:26.958 --> 01:26:27.958
That's the first voice...

1028
01:26:36.416 --> 01:26:37.999
It's visible now...

1029
01:26:40.500 --> 01:26:42.165
Just a second... Let me open...

1030
01:26:43.250 --> 01:26:44.690
Can you see it?
- Hang on a second...

1031
01:26:45.958 --> 01:26:48.082
You must be happy that
this is the last step...

1032
01:26:48.166 --> 01:26:50.246
The morning bell will help
you surmount this climb...

1033
01:26:50.250 --> 01:26:52.665
Read carefully before
giving your suggestion...

1034
01:26:52.750 --> 01:26:54.999
Because the above words will
decide who the victor is...

1035
01:26:55.125 --> 01:26:57.165
I have got a flu with this clue man...

1036
01:26:57.250 --> 01:27:01.249
One moment... Morning bell...

1037
01:27:01.750 --> 01:27:03.874
Morning bell... Our period bell...

1038
01:27:14.500 --> 01:27:16.165
Bell... bell...

1039
01:27:16.875 --> 01:27:17.915
There's the period bell...

1040
01:27:18.041 --> 01:27:20.202
They are already on top...
They will reach before us...

1041
01:27:22.166 --> 01:27:23.499
What are they doing?

1042
01:27:27.666 --> 01:27:29.415
Pseudo come now...

1043
01:27:48.041 --> 01:27:50.999
You bell... It's a wrong bell!

1044
01:28:11.666 --> 01:28:13.249
Again... the wrong bell!

1045
01:28:14.750 --> 01:28:18.124
Rohan! Again the wrong bell!

1046
01:28:18.750 --> 01:28:21.040
Think... Think...
You are smart one right?

1047
01:28:21.250 --> 01:28:23.165
You must be happy that
this is the last step...

1048
01:28:23.250 --> 01:28:25.665
Last step... Last step...

1049
01:28:25.750 --> 01:28:27.249
You must be happy...

1050
01:28:27.333 --> 01:28:29.415
Last step... Last step...

1051
01:28:31.041 --> 01:28:33.582
Second step... Second step... KBC..

1052
01:28:33.666 --> 01:28:35.124
You must be happy...

1053
01:28:35.250 --> 01:28:38.582
You must be happy today...

1054
01:28:39.125 --> 01:28:40.165
Bachchan...

1055
01:28:53.625 --> 01:28:54.874
Common milkaha singh common.

1056
01:29:31.958 --> 01:29:34.582
After the treasure hunt four
students have been eliminated...

1057
01:29:35.166 --> 01:29:37.457
And now you guys have
reached the Top 12...

1058
01:29:38.125 --> 01:29:40.499
The next step is
the dance competition...

1059
01:29:41.291 --> 01:29:43.915
Please remember it is
important to get a date...

1060
01:29:44.250 --> 01:29:47.415
meaning a partner...
Or else you will be eliminated...

1061
01:29:56.500 --> 01:29:57.421
Come let's celebrate...

1062
01:29:57.583 --> 01:29:58.332
What? Your defeat?

1063
01:29:58.416 --> 01:30:00.749
No... Your victory...
I'm coming to your house...

1064
01:30:00.958 --> 01:30:01.499
Why?

1065
01:30:01.750 --> 01:30:02.915
Home cooked food...

1066
01:30:03.041 --> 01:30:03.999
They don't cook at your house?

1067
01:30:04.125 --> 01:30:04.926
Of course they do...

1068
01:30:04.958 --> 01:30:06.749
But I'm tired of
room service at home...

1069
01:30:07.958 --> 01:30:08.915
Ok come...

1070
01:30:17.166 --> 01:30:19.790
So then come more often...

1071
01:30:20.250 --> 01:30:22.249
Even today I had to
invite myself over...

1072
01:30:22.333 --> 01:30:25.040
You do know that your
grandson is not normal...

1073
01:30:25.333 --> 01:30:27.124
Did he fall
somewhere when he was young?

1074
01:30:27.500 --> 01:30:29.582
Just focus on your dal...

1075
01:30:29.666 --> 01:30:31.957
Abhi...
Is that the way you speak to guests?

1076
01:30:32.291 --> 01:30:36.332
Rohan my son...
I can call you that, right?

1077
01:30:38.250 --> 01:30:40.957
Just wanted to say that your page
3 photographs don't do justice...

1078
01:30:41.125 --> 01:30:44.582
You are far more charming
and handsome in real life...

1079
01:30:45.458 --> 01:30:48.582
Keep some butter aside
for the bread, Geeta...

1080
01:30:49.166 --> 01:30:50.582
Butter is so expensive, Mom...

1081
01:30:50.708 --> 01:30:53.540
We have to make do with
words in this house...

1082
01:30:55.541 --> 01:30:59.665
Rohan... We are shareholders
in your Dad's company...

1083
01:31:00.166 --> 01:31:01.332
I'm sorry about that, sir...

1084
01:31:01.583 --> 01:31:04.957
No, no... We have earned quite well...

1085
01:31:06.041 --> 01:31:09.499
Abhi... Do get some tips on
the stocks and let me know...

1086
01:31:09.583 --> 01:31:11.749
Even we should benefit
from your friendship, right?

1087
01:31:12.333 --> 01:31:13.374
Don't worry, uncle...

1088
01:31:13.666 --> 01:31:16.540
I will benefit so much from him
that I will leave him far behind...

1089
01:31:16.666 --> 01:31:18.749
Yes, yes... Why not?
Buy the Taj Mahal too...

1090
01:31:19.041 --> 01:31:20.707
You don't need money to dream, do you?

1091
01:31:21.500 --> 01:31:23.874
Stupid people like you
and me dream, aunty...

1092
01:31:24.125 --> 01:31:25.915
Abhi is a blue chip investment...

1093
01:31:26.250 --> 01:31:28.582
..he will not rest till
you are all millionaires...

1094
01:31:29.958 --> 01:31:31.082
Watch my words!

1095
01:31:35.750 --> 01:31:37.332
Pass me the pickle!

1096
01:31:47.916 --> 01:31:49.836
Felt good when you took
up for me with my aunt...

1097
01:31:50.791 --> 01:31:52.999
Felt like someone my
own was talking...

1098
01:31:53.875 --> 01:31:57.165
I never knew Mr Nanda's
son had this talent too...

1099
01:31:57.333 --> 01:31:59.040
A slap and a
compliment both together...

1100
01:31:59.166 --> 01:32:01.086
is that how they say
'Thank you' in your village?

1101
01:32:02.125 --> 01:32:04.999
Ok... Here it is... Thank you!

1102
01:32:06.958 --> 01:32:09.082
By the way why do you
hide your emotions so much?

1103
01:32:09.166 --> 01:32:11.332
Are you a girl? What
kind of questions are these?

1104
01:32:11.416 --> 01:32:12.790
Matters of the heart my friend...

1105
01:32:12.916 --> 01:32:15.915
No one listens at home so
I thought I would try it on you...

1106
01:32:16.250 --> 01:32:17.499
Even I have little practice...

1107
01:32:17.750 --> 01:32:20.999
The ones who listened left me
and grandma has a hearing aid...

1108
01:32:21.416 --> 01:32:23.332
So both of us are in
the same situation...

1109
01:32:23.500 --> 01:32:25.957
So we can talk to each other...

1110
01:32:26.291 --> 01:32:28.124
You... won't kiss me now, right?

1111
01:32:28.458 --> 01:32:30.457
Won't even give you a hug!

1112
01:32:33.583 --> 01:32:34.832
Abhi!
- What happened?

1113
01:32:34.958 --> 01:32:36.790
Call the ambulance, fast!
Grandma is...

1114
01:32:36.916 --> 01:32:38.757
I don't know... Just
call the damn ambulance...

1115
01:32:45.333 --> 01:32:47.165
Where are you going?
- Grandma...

1116
01:32:47.208 --> 01:32:48.648
We will take care of your grandma...

1117
01:32:48.666 --> 01:32:51.207
Every house you go...
There's only bad luck!

1118
01:32:59.416 --> 01:33:00.332
Leave me...

1119
01:33:01.875 --> 01:33:02.749
This is wrong...

1120
01:33:22.333 --> 01:33:24.332
Are you ok? Or do
you want one more hug?

1121
01:33:30.791 --> 01:33:34.749
The condition is stable now but
the next 48 hours are critical...

1122
01:33:47.708 --> 01:33:49.499
I know you are angry with me...

1123
01:33:49.958 --> 01:33:51.415
You don't even look at me...

1124
01:33:52.125 --> 01:33:53.565
I don't know what I have done but...

1125
01:33:53.583 --> 01:33:55.749
Can I please listen to
your sad tale later?

1126
01:33:57.583 --> 01:34:00.249
I know... That's why I came to meet...

1127
01:34:09.166 --> 01:34:10.874
Yes... why?

1128
01:34:11.166 --> 01:34:13.457
What kind of clothes
have you worn Shanaya?

1129
01:34:13.750 --> 01:34:17.415
What do I do?
I don't have hospital type clothes...

1130
01:34:18.250 --> 01:34:21.332
But don't worry...
I'm going shopping today...

1131
01:34:23.041 --> 01:34:25.749
Because I want to come everyday...

1132
01:34:54.750 --> 01:35:00.874
"Love with deep colour,
with passion and with ardour."

1133
01:35:01.958 --> 01:35:07.499
"Which is more than just love.
That kind of love."

1134
01:35:07.583 --> 01:35:10.582
"Love that's about love."

1135
01:35:10.750 --> 01:35:14.582
"When it pained today,
it was a bit more than usual."

1136
01:35:14.666 --> 01:35:16.957
"Love that is about love."

1137
01:35:17.750 --> 01:35:19.499
"Don't know what has happened,.."

1138
01:35:19.583 --> 01:35:21.749
"..I just know that it
is a bit more than usual."

1139
01:35:21.875 --> 01:35:24.040
"Love that is about love."

1140
01:35:24.958 --> 01:35:26.749
"If it happened the
same way to her too,.."

1141
01:35:26.875 --> 01:35:28.915
"..I will say that it
happened more to me than her."

1142
01:35:28.958 --> 01:35:31.165
"Love that is about real love."

1143
01:35:37.000 --> 01:35:40.415
"As if my sleep has
broken for the first time."

1144
01:35:40.583 --> 01:35:44.040
"And I've seen the
morning rubbing my eyes."

1145
01:35:44.166 --> 01:35:48.499
"By keeping your light, the sun
shone more, and the day is on its top."

1146
01:35:48.583 --> 01:35:50.540
I want to meet Grandma...

1147
01:35:51.166 --> 01:35:52.165
No...

1148
01:35:52.500 --> 01:35:54.749
Why? I'm looking right, am I not?
- "He peeps behind the net of clouds."

1149
01:35:55.250 --> 01:35:58.332
Yes... To go to a temple...
- "This moonlight stares at me so much."

1150
01:35:58.416 --> 01:36:04.332
"Keeping brightness in himself,
my moon is hidden here only." - Shanaya.

1151
01:36:04.416 --> 01:36:07.165
"Love, that's about real, deep love."

1152
01:36:07.583 --> 01:36:11.499
"When it pained today,
it was a bit more than usual."

1153
01:36:11.583 --> 01:36:14.374
"Love that is about love."

1154
01:36:14.583 --> 01:36:16.415
"Don't know what has happened,.."

1155
