"..I just know that
it is a bit more than usual."

1156
01:36:18.708 --> 01:36:20.749
"Love that is about love."

1157
01:36:21.750 --> 01:36:23.707
"If it happened the
same way to her too.."

1158
01:36:23.791 --> 01:36:25.707
"..I will say that
it happened more to me than her."

1159
01:36:25.791 --> 01:36:28.207
"Love that is about real love."

1160
01:37:02.791 --> 01:37:07.249
"If it happens so, that you meet me..

1161
01:37:07.333 --> 01:37:12.957
..and disappear with me."

1162
01:37:13.416 --> 01:37:21.416
"It will take place slowly,
by persuading, be patient, o my heart."

1163
01:37:24.583 --> 01:37:28.040
"When the shooting star fell down.."

1164
01:37:28.125 --> 01:37:31.665
"..I started asking for
your heart a bit more."

1165
01:37:31.750 --> 01:37:36.832
"Sometimes this crazy heart does
not listen to me, in this love."

1166
01:37:36.958 --> 01:37:39.332
"Love that is about real love."

1167
01:37:40.208 --> 01:37:43.957
"This heart was very stupid,
but today it's even more stupid."

1168
01:37:44.083 --> 01:37:46.999
"Love, that is about love."

1169
01:37:47.125 --> 01:37:50.999
"I don't know why but
The fear of losing you became greater."

1170
01:37:51.125 --> 01:37:53.874
"Love, that is about love."

1171
01:37:54.333 --> 01:37:58.582
"When it pained today,
it was a bit more than usual."

1172
01:37:59.666 --> 01:38:05.499
"Love with deep colour,
with passion and with ardour."

1173
01:38:06.875 --> 01:38:12.874
"Which is more than just love.
That kind of love."

1174
01:38:13.875 --> 01:38:20.124
"Love with deep colour,
with passion and with ardour."

1175
01:38:21.125 --> 01:38:26.624
"Which is more than just love.
That kind of love."

1176
01:38:26.708 --> 01:38:29.499
"Love, that is about love."

1177
01:38:38.416 --> 01:38:40.040
Doctors are saying it's serious...

1178
01:38:42.958 --> 01:38:46.040
If something happens to you
I will never speak to you...

1179
01:38:49.875 --> 01:38:51.749
Never speak with
your back to a person...

1180
01:39:03.166 --> 01:39:06.582
There's something... Urgent...

1181
01:39:09.166 --> 01:39:10.165
Tell me...

1182
01:39:10.958 --> 01:39:12.624
After I go...

1183
01:39:13.875 --> 01:39:18.332
Please put a nice picture of
mine in the drawing room...

1184
01:39:19.583 --> 01:39:20.790
A smiling one...

1185
01:40:01.666 --> 01:40:04.165
Abhi was broken
after Grandma's death...

1186
01:40:04.958 --> 01:40:06.249
He became quiet...

1187
01:40:08.166 --> 01:40:09.686
He wasn't saying anything to anyone...

1188
01:40:14.666 --> 01:40:15.999
Rohan's room is ahead...

1189
01:40:17.250 --> 01:40:18.874
I came to meet you...

1190
01:40:20.958 --> 01:40:22.165
To condole me?

1191
01:40:24.958 --> 01:40:27.540
Rohan was saying you
don't want to meet anyone...

1192
01:40:28.166 --> 01:40:29.082
You can't be alone like this...

1193
01:40:29.166 --> 01:40:30.790
I have to get used to being alone...

1194
01:40:33.166 --> 01:40:34.582
Everyone who was close has left...

1195
01:40:36.125 --> 01:40:38.749
You stay away too... Or you will die!

1196
01:40:40.041 --> 01:40:40.874
You need a friend...

1197
01:40:41.000 --> 01:40:42.415
We can't be friends, Shanaya...

1198
01:40:42.500 --> 01:40:43.874
Do you want to be my friend?

1199
01:41:00.916 --> 01:41:01.499
What are you doing?

1200
01:41:01.583 --> 01:41:04.499
Shanaya... Just go...
I don't want to meet anyone...

1201
01:41:04.583 --> 01:41:06.874
Go... I said Go...

1202
01:41:07.541 --> 01:41:10.874
But Abhi... This won't suit you...

1203
01:41:25.000 --> 01:41:30.957
"This is love."

1204
01:42:47.583 --> 01:42:48.343
What are you doing?

1205
01:42:48.416 --> 01:42:51.915
You shut your mouth...
You showed your true class...

1206
01:42:52.041 --> 01:42:53.665
Came down to your true cheap self...

1207
01:42:53.750 --> 01:42:56.165
I should never have
indulged small people like you...

1208
01:42:56.375 --> 01:42:59.040
I was your best friend...
And what did you do?

1209
01:42:59.875 --> 01:43:00.835
You are no one's Abhi...

1210
01:43:00.958 --> 01:43:03.415
No one's... That's why
there's no one for you...

1211
01:43:03.500 --> 01:43:07.249
Everyone's dead... Mom... Dad...
Grandma... Everyone!

1212
01:43:13.875 --> 01:43:17.124
If you say one more word about my Mom
or Dad I will break your face...

1213
01:43:17.666 --> 01:43:18.665
You couldn't belong
to your Mom and Dad...

1214
01:43:18.750 --> 01:43:20.071
What best friend are you of mine?

1215
01:43:20.125 --> 01:43:22.332
You talk about class... Status...
What are you?

1216
01:43:22.416 --> 01:43:24.540
You just waste your
father's money and time...

1217
01:43:24.625 --> 01:43:25.832
Father's money... Father's money...

1218
01:43:25.958 --> 01:43:27.832
You were always after
my father's success...

1219
01:43:27.958 --> 01:43:29.332
Isn't that why you
became friends with me?

1220
01:43:29.500 --> 01:43:30.915
You wanted to live my life...

1221
01:43:31.041 --> 01:43:32.499
That's why you wanted to
snatch my girlfriend...

1222
01:43:32.583 --> 01:43:34.165
Stop this nonsense of
girlfriend-boyfriend...

1223
01:43:34.250 --> 01:43:35.749
Shanaya has never loved you and you?

1224
01:43:35.875 --> 01:43:37.582
You pounce on every second girl...

1225
01:43:37.666 --> 01:43:39.249
You have no right to
call her your girlfriend...

1226
01:43:39.333 --> 01:43:40.582
Don't teach me my rights...

1227
01:43:40.666 --> 01:43:42.082
Shanaya is mine and only mine...

1228
01:43:42.166 --> 01:43:43.374
Why don't you ask
her who she belongs to?

1229
01:43:43.458 --> 01:43:45.165
Shanaya loves me...

1230
01:43:53.791 --> 01:43:55.499
What do you two know about me?

1231
01:43:55.666 --> 01:43:57.124
About my feelings?

1232
01:43:57.416 --> 01:43:58.499
Nothing...

1233
